{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "06U5", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:847611737d4904947d6b87b4335b90899454f1bf3d8a739cd6535c15498a0230", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThus we may use the following natural definition.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:35322e4680cc43900423677afa805c977a7e233dfb5b517fe59270b0a952b65f", "unit_id": "tag:06U5:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "06U5", "placeholders": {"FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001": "}", "FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001": "\\footnote{", "MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$|\\mathcal{X}| \\to |\\mathcal{Y}|$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{Y}' \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{Y}' \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}'$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{topology-definition-submersive}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0002": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0002": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-submersive}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:e98543b2ab6f5180f9cf18057618a9aba7fc4b1ade6538343a8df3a7019cd265", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:bd22b1f05dca292e14fd0c0fb9e9818983d654490a24ca93c5f7acf2fbfa4d65", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> We say <MATH_0002> is <TEXTITOPEN_0001>submersive<TEXTITCLOSE_0001><FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>This is very different\nfrom the notion of a submersion of differential manifolds.<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>\nif the continuous map <MATH_0003> is submersive, see\nTopology, Definition <REF_0001>.\n<STRUCT_0003> We say <MATH_0004> is <TEXTITOPEN_0002>universally submersive<TEXTITCLOSE_0002> if for every\nmorphism of algebraic stacks <MATH_0005>\nthe base change <MATH_0006>\nis submersive.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:720082b0db48ec29115bcc1e8a4989f893e9e1aba0be0309b37a6072c91044ff", "unit_id": "tag:06U6:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "06U5", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:847611737d4904947d6b87b4335b90899454f1bf3d8a739cd6535c15498a0230", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nWe note that a submersive morphism is in particular surjective.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6b6d79c3180d0837080bdc7ae4e6856280e613fee33a333fc31cdc0c72ad5375", "unit_id": "tag:06U5:prose-0003"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06U5", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-universally-submersive}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b943d79bca843f49514f6a20aa7639634778f7928063d5ff5fdb6bb5b49708d6", "source_text": "The base change of a universally submersive morphism of algebraic stacks\nby any morphism of algebraic stacks is universally submersive.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:46f0897ff2842099463d0eaf1286a21c20e81dea6561d1858cbc5012ce517a86", "unit_id": "tag:0CHY:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06U5", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d7b86db85c7cdf93b23287f6ab49dee036a65172b9e19380b59ade96bfba6f1e", "source_text": "This is immediate from the definition.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ed527da30f69c9bcc90112222bdf3d207c927d6febb801818b673598175ce475", "unit_id": "tag:0CHY:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06U5", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-composition-universally-submersive}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8ba28bcdce7e2af6eeacef90d4d24f6a5c2fb9455b3dfa3882a4784a66ea1df1", "source_text": "The composition of a pair of (universally) submersive morphisms of\nalgebraic stacks is (universally) submersive.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:867cc12be9debc39e6444ceff9ed9b58d932b7bd458e3752344a98a3075d3b33", "unit_id": "tag:0CHZ:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06U5", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d7b86db85c7cdf93b23287f6ab49dee036a65172b9e19380b59ade96bfba6f1e", "source_text": "Omitted.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:872a8cfa74892c6e6464bd864d9f1c292f4f523caba3e51ac3dafbfc84db48f6", "unit_id": "tag:0CHZ:proof"}
